{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T01:19:18+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I commissioned some butterflies 2", "steam_appid": 2953720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>You may also like</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>A hidden object game where you must find all the butterflies and flowers to complete each level.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2>🖼️ 15 Unique artworks<br>❓ 1500+ Hidden objects total<br>🦋 750+ Butterflies<br>🌺 750+ Flowers <br>💡 ∞ Unlimited hints if you get stuck<br>♻️ Restore a small number of hidden objects to a painting so you can find them again!<br>🎵 Music and ambiance for each artwork<br>⌨️ Use your keyboard to move/zoom in if you have no scroll wheel<br>💾 3x save slots<br>🗑️ Reset progress entirely and play again<br>🕒 Timer included to show how long you took to complete each level<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Context:</h2>The brief was simple. I commissioned artists to create a fantasy world, and hide as many butterflies and flowers as they can inside it. Now it’s your job to find them all! With 15 art pieces to choose from, and 1500+ hidden objects, you will have a lot of searching to do.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2>Use your mouse to move around the image and zoom in / out. When you find a hidden object, click it and it will disappear. You can also use WASD to move and the arrow keys to zoom.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty:</h2>All levels start unlocked, your progress is saved as you play, and you can use hints if you get stuck.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get immersed:</h2>Each painting has its own music to help you connect with the world, as you search for everything.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayable</h2>You can restore a small number of hidden objects back into a painting so you can find them again! It’s much harder when there are only a few hidden objects left (especially randomly). You can also use up to 3 save slots so you can replay without progress loss. Alternatively, you can reset your progress for the entire game if you’d like to start over.<br><br>", "about_the_game": "A hidden object game where you must find all the butterflies and flowers to complete each level.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2>🖼️ 15 Unique artworks<br>❓ 1500+ Hidden objects total<br>🦋 750+ Butterflies<br>🌺 750+ Flowers <br>💡 ∞ Unlimited hints if you get stuck<br>♻️ Restore a small number of hidden objects to a painting so you can find them again!<br>🎵 Music and ambiance for each artwork<br>⌨️ Use your keyboard to move/zoom in if you have no scroll wheel<br>💾 3x save slots<br>🗑️ Reset progress entirely and play again<br>🕒 Timer included to show how long you took to complete each level<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Context:</h2>The brief was simple. I commissioned artists to create a fantasy world, and hide as many butterflies and flowers as they can inside it. Now it’s your job to find them all! With 15 art pieces to choose from, and 1500+ hidden objects, you will have a lot of searching to do.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2>Use your mouse to move around the image and zoom in / out. When you find a hidden object, click it and it will disappear. You can also use WASD to move and the arrow keys to zoom.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty:</h2>All levels start unlocked, your progress is saved as you play, and you can use hints if you get stuck.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get immersed:</h2>Each painting has its own music to help you connect with the world, as you search for everything.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayable</h2>You can restore a small number of hidden objects back into a painting so you can find them again! It’s much harder when there are only a few hidden objects left (especially randomly). You can also use up to 3 save slots so you can replay without progress loss. Alternatively, you can reset your progress for the entire game if you’d like to start over.<br><br>", "short_description": "I paid artists to hide butterflies and flowers in 15 artworks. Can you find them all? Warning: Relaxing.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“”<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Read more on PC Gamer</h2><br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953720/header.jpg?t=1761712486", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953720/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761712486", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953720/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761712486", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Follow the fun"], "publishers": ["I commissioned some series"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 399, "final": 399, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$3.99"}, "packages": [1051715], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy I commissioned some butterflies 2", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1051715, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "I commissioned some butterflies 2 - $3.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 399}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953720/ss_af